The Ultimate Guide to Hosting the Best Instagram Giveaways to Generate More Followers
Instagram has emerged as a platform that businesses want to get on to. Today, businesses can easily connect with their Instagram followers and establish a personal connection in ways that aren’t possible with traditional marketing efforts.
Why are contests and giveaways important?
You could end up giving your product or service to someone who just joined the giveaway for fun and if they end up liking it, they may become a regular customer of your business. In this way, it can be a sample of what they can expect from your brand’s products.
What rules should you follow? When it comes to Instagram contests and giveaways, you need to be aware of the rules that govern them so that you don’t compromise your brand’s integrity.
If you’re benefiting from influencer marketing, it’s necessary to follow the rules of disclosure.
You have to include a statement in the contest rules releasing Instagram from any responsibility for the contest. As per the platform’s promotion guidelines, entrants need to be informed that your contest “is in no way sponsored, endorsed or administered by, or associated with, Instagram.”
