CutStory is available on iOS only and allows you to cut longer videos so that you can create 15 second videos to meet the Instagram Stories requirement. It supports all formats of videos and can produce a stream of 15 second videos for you to be able to post to your Instagram Stories directly.
Jumprope is the perfect app available on iOS if you want to create “how to” style content for your Instagram Stories like sharing recipes, fitness routines, make-up tutorials. You get personalised templates, and can make use of its filters, time-lapse, text overlays, colours, animations, and voiceover.
A Design Kit is available on iOS devices only and can help you give your Instagram Stories an artistic touch. There are more than 120 designs and template options for you along with over 30 font choices.
Microsoft Hyperlapse is supported on Android and desktop systems and allows you to create time-lapse videos for your stories. You can also use it to adjust the speed of your current videos and increase the speed up to 32 times the normal video speed.
