Fiber laser cutting can make up for the disadvantages of plasma cutting , especially the development of high power fiber laser cutting , which solves the limitation of thick plate cutting in the past of years , and is favored by more and more sheet metal processing users.
Because fiber laser beam can be focused into a very small spot, the laser slit is smaller for the same size plate, the slit of plasma cutting is larger. Compared with plasma cutting, fiber laser cutting can save 6-9% of materials.
Fiber laser cutting has not contact with the surface of the workpiece, with small slits, high precision, smooth end faces, no burns, which can meet the high precision requirements of aerospace, power equipment, petroleum equipment, automobile manufacturing, and more industries. fiber laser cutting
Besides, fiber laser cutting is a non-contact cutting, ensure that the workpieces is not scratched, the cutting edge is less affected by heat, no thermal deformation, and the whole process is environment friendly .
