Five outstanding point of fiber laser cutting machines may answer it:
Fast cutting speed: about twice the cutting speed of CO2 laser machine or plasma cutting machine ;
High performance : the stable performance was acquired through the application of world’s top fiber laser source which makes it possible to cut at any point with equal quality through fiber transmission. For example , Reci , Raycus and Max laser source is very stable now .
Low maintenance cost: fiber transmission without using reflective lenses saves a lot of time in optical path adjustment and achieves maintenance-free results.
