Surge protector provides a simple, economical and reliable protection method for the power surge protection of electronic equipment. By means of surge protector (MOV), the surge energy can be quickly transmitted to the earth in case of lightning strike induction and operating overvoltage, so as to protect the equipment from damage.
Isolation method mainly uses the isolation transformer with shielding layer.Because common-mode interference is a kind of relatively terrestrial interference, it is transmitted mainly through the coupling capacitance between transformer windings.If a shielding layer is inserted between the primary and secondary, and the shielding layer is well grounded, the interfering voltage can be shunned through the shielding layer, thus reducing the interfering voltage at the output.
This method because the transformer function is too single, relative volume, weight, installation is not very convenient, in the middle and low frequency peak and surge protection effect is not good, so the market is limited, manufacturers are not much.So it’s not usually used on special occasions.
Absorbing method mainly uses wave absorbing device to absorb the interference voltage of surge peak.Absorbing devices all have a common characteristic, that is, they present high impedance below the threshold voltage, and once the threshold voltage is exceeded, the impedance drops sharply, so they have a certain inhibitory effect on the peak voltage.
