With the development and innovation of power electronics technology, switching power supply is widely used in almost all electronic equipment with its characteristics of small size, light weight and high efficiency.Switching power supply chips are used in air purifier adapters, LCD chargers, communication equipment chargers, security monitoring chargers, digital products and instruments and other charger fields.
1. High efficiency：Switching power supply transistors work in the switching state, the switching transistor power loss is small, the efficiency can be greatly improved, the efficiency is usually up to 80% ~ 90% or so.
3, wide voltage range：Switching voltage regulator power supply in the input AC voltage from which to 264V changes inch, can achieve good voltage regulation, the change of the output voltage can be guaranteed to be less than 2%.And in the input AC voltage changes always maintain the high efficiency of the voltage regulator circuit.
6, low power consumption：Because the transistor works in the switching state, the power loss is small, there is no need to use a large radiator, the temperature rise in the machine is small, the surrounding components are not damaged because of long-term work in the high temperature environment.Therefore, the use of switching regulated power supply can also help to improve the reliability of the whole machine.
